    "I'll be respectful. No harassment, hate, threats, spam or sharing people's private details. Find A Crib removes anyone who breaks these rules." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seré respetuoso. Nada de acoso, odio, amenazas, spam ni compartir datos privados de otros. Find A Crib expulsa a quien rompa estas reglas."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "예의를 지키겠습니다. 괴롭힘, 혐오, 협박, 스팸, 다른 사람의 개인정보 공유는 금지입니다. 규칙을 어기면 Find A Crib이 내보냅니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我会互相尊重。不骚扰、不发表仇恨言论、不威胁、不发垃圾信息、不泄露他人隐私。违反规则者会被 Find A Crib 移出。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我會互相尊重。不騷擾、不發表仇恨言論、不威脅、不發垃圾訊息、不洩露他人隱私。違反規則者會被 Find A Crib 移出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm here to" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
