          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "審查我的租約"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roaches, mice, rats and bedbugs an HPD inspector confirmed inside an apartment here, newest first. This is the one record that is current: the bedbug filings are the landlord's own annual report about last year, and the Health Department only inspects for rats." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cucarachas, ratones, ratas y chinches que un inspector de HPD confirmó dentro de un apartamento aquí, de lo más reciente a lo más antiguo. Este es el único registro actual: los reportes de chinches son el informe anual del propio propietario sobre el año pasado, y el Departamento de Salud solo inspecciona ratas."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HPD 점검관이 이곳 아파트 안에서 확인한 바퀴벌레, 생쥐, 쥐, 빈대(최신순). 최신 기록은 이것뿐입니다. 빈대 신고는 집주인이 직접 낸 작년 연례 보고서이고, 보건국은 쥐만 점검합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HPD 检查员在此公寓内确认的蟑螂、小鼠、大鼠和臭虫，按时间由新到旧。这是唯一的最新记录：臭虫申报是房东自己提交的上一年度报告，卫生局只检查大鼠。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HPD 檢查員在此公寓內確認的蟑螂、小鼠、大鼠和臭蟲，按時間由新到舊。這是唯一的最新記錄：臭蟲申報是房東自己提交的上一年度報告，衛生局只檢查大鼠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roaches, mice, rats or bedbugs" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
